@startuml
actor Student
participant FlashcardController
participant FlashcardReviewService
database FlashcardRepository
database FlashcardReviewRepository
Student -> FlashcardController: open review
FlashcardController -> FlashcardReviewService: list(course)
FlashcardReviewService -> FlashcardRepository: load deterministic cards
FlashcardController --> Student: question and reveal control
Student -> FlashcardController: rating(card, rating)
FlashcardController -> FlashcardReviewService: review(...)
FlashcardReviewService -> FlashcardRepository: validate course ownership
FlashcardReviewService -> FlashcardReviewRepository: append review event
FlashcardController --> Student: next/current review state
@enduml
